<title>USA: Suffolk Cty, N.Y., won by Prudential Sec..</title>
<headline>Suffolk Cty, N.Y., won by Prudential Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Sec. said it won $27.715 million of Suffolk Cty, N.Y., public improvement bonds, 1997, Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.1389 percent.</p>
</text>
